{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seedrun</strong> is a short, minimalist farming game with many satisfying tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant seeds, water crops, pluck weeds and harvest your plants before they spoil.  <br>Your crops can assist you with your tasks by watering seedlings, getting resources &amp; more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875810/extras/623208d31cff13ddb4ee3ae48c26b4fb.poster.avif?t=1756823002\" width=780 height=227 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875810/extras/623208d31cff13ddb4ee3ae48c26b4fb.webm?t=1756823002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop wood &amp; stone to build bridges so you can expand your farm and discover even more plants and buildings.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875810/extras/60f0ebfa8fe4053e8dc2bd1953b9b38d.poster.avif?t=1756823002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875810/extras/60f0ebfa8fe4053e8dc2bd1953b9b38d.webm?t=1756823002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: Complete quests to grow the Skill Tree until it is tall enough for you to climb out of the cave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"ht